Hi Emily,

I am not able to process the bin.gz file as a GENEActiv file, even if I unzip it. Please send me the milestone data (RData format create by GGIR) from the meta/basic folder as I asked for.

Also, I see you are testing the advanced sleeplog with g.loadlog. This is not possible for advanced sleeplogs. It only works for basic sleeplogs, because when an advanced sleeplog is used the function also requires complementary information from GGIR itself.

Vincent
