Hi John,

Is there a way in the ActivPAL software to inspect the csv file and check the start time? I do not have their software but maybe you do? If yes, then that would give a hint as to whether the timestamp is wrong in the data or only wrong in the software.

I am afraid there is not much I can do to address code problems for this because all I have is the mysterious conversion steps from the unconventional ActivPAL timestamp format to something we can read. The conversion was supposed to work. If it does not then I am not sure what to do. ActivPAL has been unresponsive to my email a while ago. However, maybe you could reach out to them as their client and ask for clarification on how the timestamps relate to real time?

Best wishes,

Vincent

