  mvpathreshold =c(50,150,500), # MVPA threshold, can enter more than 1 value
  bout.metric = 4,
  closedbout=FALSE,
  timewindow = c("MM"), #to specify whether days should be defined from midnight to midnight "MM", from waking-up to waking-up "WW", or both c("MM","WW")
  do.report=c(2))

Thank you for your help!

Allison

