In the case you are looking at the output from part 5, you may be interested in the data_cleaning_file, it will allow you to exclude that specific day from the part 5 report. See documentation here <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/GGIRParameters.html#:~:text=setting%20is%20TRUE.-,data_cleaning_file,-Character%20(default%20=%20NULL>.

Best,
Jairo

